      }
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "legend": {
     "displayMode": "list",
     "placement": "bottom"
    },
    "tooltip": {
     "mode": "multi"
    }
   },
   "description": "drafts: an operator already holds the maximum number of open drafts. ai_runs_per_user / ai_runs_per_day: the daily allowance of automatic document checks per applicant or for the whole platform is spent; the check is stored as unavailable and no model is called."
  },
